<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT KENT BY SIX WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT KENT BY SIX WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>CANTERBURY, England 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat Kent by six wickets in their three-day match ending on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Kent 201 and 343 (M.Ealham 85, T.Ward 68, A.Wells 65; S.Lee 4-86), Australia 315 and 231-4 (R.Ponting 56 not out).</p>
</text>
